    <briefdescription>
<para>The visible tick and subtick values, with formatted labels, for one axis viewport. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds data-space values and label text only; no pixel geometry. Placement (padding, font metrics, rotation, value-to-pixel mapping) is resolved in <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Axis_1a3613ed1b3cae19f09cc42571153a751c" kindref="member">Axis::paint()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Built on the GUI thread by <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1AxisTickPainter_1ab562bfd5e90de190ede26dee32247ae7" kindref="member">AxisTickPainter::computeTicks()</ref></computeroutput>, because label formatting may call into the QML/JS engine, and consumed by <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Axis_1a3613ed1b3cae19f09cc42571153a751c" kindref="member">Axis::paint()</ref></computeroutput>, which runs on the render thread with the threaded render loop. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
